ll}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":16,"created_at":"2025-04-11T09:21:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T22:24:03Z","closed_at":"2025-04-21T13:31:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-21T13:31:07Z"},"body":"Supersedes #81630\r\nImplements: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4173\r\n\r\nCreates support for checkable property groups through the `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE` property hint that is given to the `enabled` boolean. This property hint modifies the (sub)group to display a checkbox on its right. When the checkbox is clicked, the linked property is enabled and the group is unfolded. This PR also hides the corresponding \"enable\" property when it is inside a checkable group, saving vertical screen space.\r\n\r\nThis PR also makes the change that when a property group does not have any children, then it is unable to be unfolded and does not draw the unfolding arrow. This can be seen in the `Rotation Smoothing` property group in the example images.\r\n\r\n| Before (4.4, `Limit` didn't have an enable option yet)  | After |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| <img width=\"280\" alt=\"Before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24bd0e28-8b22-4302-acd2-9238d9d4ca4e\" />  | <img width=\"275\" alt=\"After\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb6ddcc8-1c1d-4519-b98c-df7ecd4264f3\" />  |\r\n\r\nAs opposed to #81630, this PR chooses to have the checkboxes align to the right. This change makes the position of the text consistent, as before the text would jump to the right when the group was checkable.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272/reactions","total_count":32,"+1":23,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}